OL,3,GNEWSASplit over fate of historic chapel
OL,4,Ain Bronte country
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disused chapel in Bronte country
OL,7,Fcould be demolished after a plan to
OL,8,Freplace it with terraced homes was
OL,9,Fsubmitted.
OL,11,FResidents in Haworth are split over the
OL,12,Ffate of the Primitive Methodist Chapel
OL,13,Fon Mill Hey, according to local
OL,14,Fcouncillor Rebecca Poulsen.
OL,16,FA Bradford Council planning officer
OL,17,Fwill make a final decision on the
OL,18,Fapplication next year.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
